# Docker build context slimming — the docserver image only COPYs
# Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock, core/, services/, core-enterprise/.
# Keep the context tiny (was 7.9 GB because target/ + node_modules rode along).
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!core
!core/**
!services
!services/**
!core-enterprise
!core-enterprise/**
core/target
services/*/node_modules
**/.git
